            <div xml:id="d515">

                <pb facs="0793" n="667" xml:id="pg667"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/6285: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bancroft</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-06-17T11:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 17,
                                1925—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 17—8:55
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>112. Your telegram to Peking number 107, June 13 [<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >12</hi>], 5 p.m. Last evening I conveyed purport to Foreign Minister who
                    expressed gratification.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bancroft</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
